# Copy to .env.local for local development.
#
# Both values are safe to expose: the publishable key ships inside every browser
# that loads the site. Row-level security in Postgres is what actually protects
# submissions, not the secrecy of this key.
#
# These must ALSO be set in the Cloudflare Pages project settings, or the
# deployed portal will not connect. The public calendar works without them.
